# Prototype apps/mischief in alchemy dev: root page, llms.txt, and an MCP with one resource and one prompt

## Step

Build the smallest `apps/mischief` that runs under `alchemy dev` in workerd: `GET /` plain text, `GET /llms.txt`, `/mcp` with one resource (`AGENTS.md`) and one prompt (a stub skill), using the shapes from the two research assets. Joel connects an MCP client and fetches the root with curl. The point is a reaction to the page voice and the MCP shape before the content set is final. Record what felt wrong.
